<title>BRAZIL: Brazil June 20 coffee regs 3.05 mln bags to August.</title>
<headline>Brazil June 20 coffee regs 3.05 mln bags to August.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil coffee sales registrations as of June 20 totalled 3.05 million 60-kg bags for June, July and August, according to the June 30 bulletin of the Rio de Janeiro Coffee Center.</p>
<p>Of this, 1.34 million bags had been registered for June.</p>
<p>A breakdown by month was as follows. </p>
<p> MONTH     REG 60-KG BAGS-June 20    REG 60-KG BAGS-June 13</p>
<p> June		   1,342,077		1,390,517</p>
<p> July		   1,231,793		1,008,210</p>
<p> August		   479,750		  401,995</p>
<p> TOTAL		  3,053,620		2,800,722</p>
<p>((-Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151))</p>
</text>
